  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ganki Toro Market Gardening Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Irrigated Agriculture.Beneficiaries: 116.The project funds will be used to develop 12.2 hectares by installing a new irrigation system and building a fence around it to protect it from roaming animals. This expansion will enable Ganki Toro members to dramatically increase the volume of vegetables sold and the profit earned by its members.</narrative>
  </description>
